  I've ascended with a vanity stack of nine blessed +7 silver 
daggers named SilverStorm.  If you really want them, use the
spell of polymorph (write it if you have to) on the Castle
weapons.  Silver daggers are also part of my auto-pickup
specs.

  Using part of a wished-for magic marker to write +polymorph is 
pretty efficient.  That +poly can get you silver daggers AND
scrolls of enchant weapon to improve them with, as well as 
scrolls of enchant armor, plus whatever good luck gives you:
scrolls of charging (for Pw), genocide, scare monster, 
tame monster, etc., and possibly more magic markers.

  Bless your junk scrolls. (Although very few actually are.
e.g. Scrolls of teleport save Pw on the ascension run.)
Line up the scrolls in piles of no more than three, with no
cursed objects in the pile to stimulate golem generation.

  Set what you're looking for into your autopickup.  (You'll
have to do this manually, the defaults.nh file is only read
when a new game is started.)  Examine the results of each
poly manually, though.  You might get some lenses.

  I got my first scrolls of gold detection that way during
my first ascension.  Good thing too because I'd forgotten
about them. :-)



